            <title>[IGNITE-9556] Web console: Babel 7 rc.2 compatibility issues</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9556</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Bebel 7 rc.2 causes at least one breaking issue: AngularJS-module-related run time error happens when built for production target.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12939366/12939366_screenshot-1.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
